/** 구조 로켓 — analyze 봉 인덱스 → 차트 tail 인덱스 (time 불일치 시 마지막 봉 몰림 방지) */
export function remapStructureRocketsToChart<T extends { time: number }>(
  rows: ReadonlyArray<T>,
  chartCandles: Candle[],
  sourceCandles?: Candle[]
): T[] {
  if (!rows.length || !chartCandles.length) return [...rows];
  const src = sourceCandles?.length ? sourceCandles : chartCandles;
  return rows.map((r) => {
    const t = Number(r.time);
    if (!Number.isFinite(t)) return r;
    if (chartCandles.some((c) => Number(c.time) === t)) return r;
    const srcIdx = candleIndexAtOrBeforeInSeries(src, t);
    const chartIdx = Math.max(
      0,
      Math.min(chartCandles.length - 1, chartCandles.length - 1 - (src.length - 1 - srcIdx))
    );
    const chartT = Number(chartCandles[chartIdx]?.time);
    return Number.isFinite(chartT) ? ({ ...r, time: chartT } as T) : r;
  });
}

